      "writtenOn": "2017-11-16T20:49:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But then we won\u0027t be able to guarantee atomic update of events (across upper and lower 32-bits). The point you mentioned is valid i.e. we might enable interrupts without considering the current state. May be using get_int_mask and set_int_mask is better in this case?",
